{"parentUuid":null,"isSidechain":true,"promptId":"39e0675d-1132-4a98-9961-d8887abeb649","agentId":"a24995ce767f7ef1e","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":"You are building the Analytics page for a Shopify app called QuizSnap. Write the file at `/Users/yashbaldha/Desktop/Shopify App/QuizSnap/app/routes/app.analytics.tsx`.\n\nThis is a Shopify embedded app using React Router v7 and @shopify/polaris React components.\n\nThe Analytics page provides performance data for all published quizzes.\n\n## Page Structure:\n\n### Header\n- Title: \"Analytics\"\n- Subtitle: \"Track your quiz performance\"\n- Date range filter (Select: Last 7 days, Last 30 days, Last 90 days, All time)\n\n### Summary Stats Row (same 4 cards as dashboard but with more detail)\n- Attributed Revenue: $12,450 with trend +23%\n- Quiz Completions: 1,247 with trend +15%\n- Conversion Rate: 18.3% with trend +2.1%\n- Emails Captured: 892 with trend +31%\n\n### Charts Section\nUse Polaris `Card` with placeholder chart areas (since we can't use actual charting libs):\n1. **Completions Over Time** - Show a simple table/list representation of daily completions for the last 7 days as a data table\n2. **Top Performing Quizzes** - A horizontal bar-like display showing quiz names with their completion counts\n\n### Response Breakdown Table\nUse Polaris `DataTable`:\n- Columns: Quiz Name, Started, Completed, Drop-off Rate, Avg. Time, Emails, Revenue\n- 3-4 rows of mock data\n\n### Popular Answers Section\nA card showing the most selected answers across all quizzes:\n- \"What's your skin type?\" → Oily (42%), Dry (28%), Combination (20%), Normal (10%)\n- \"What's your main concern?\" → Acne (35%), Aging (30%), Hydration (25%), Sensitivity (10%)\n\n## Technical Requirements:\n- Use loader with `authenticate.admin(request)`\n- Use Polaris: Page, Layout, Card, Select, Text, BlockStack, InlineStack, DataTable, Badge, ProgressBar, Divider, Icon\n- Use useState for date range filter\n- Export headers using boundary.headers\n- All mock data, no real API calls\n- Do NOT use s-* web components\n"},"uuid":"73958e9d-cb02-40cc-943d-b0aac79e6ead","timestamp":"2026-03-24T19:55:20.803Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-vscode","cwd":"/Users/yashbaldha/Desktop/Shopify App/QuizSnap","sessionId":"af3bfa75-a45e-48c2-be3d-0254f9df1307","version":"2.1.81","gitBranch":"main","slug":"starry-doodling-kahan"}
